---
description: Always-on coding standards
alwaysApply: true
---

Use `/caveman ultra` in chat. Build uses `/ponytail`.

- never `any` or `unknown` — infer from schema, API, package types
- no `as` on user or API input — parse with the schema that owns the shape (`safeParse` / `zodFormikValidate`)
- hooks: skip `useCallback` unless proven need; avoid `setTimeout`; limit `useEffect` chains; `useMemo` only for expensive stable data
- SOLID + one concern per module
- dynamic unions: exhaustive switch + `assertNever` from `@/utilities/assertNever` (design: `utilities/assertNever`)
- KISS minimal diff
- DRY reuse design + existing presenters
- styling: tailwindcss, tailwind-merge, tailwind-variants
- icons: lucide-react
- follow active sub-plan under `docs/feature/*/sub-plans/`
- run scripts via pnpm per `.cursor/STRUCTURE.md`
